{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Elder\u2019s Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons of Solitude is a turn-based survival strategy set in a hand-painted prehistoric world inspired by Estonian nature and myth. You are in exile. Each trial demands foresight: read the land, endure its wildlife, and keep the ecosystem in fragile balance as shifting seasons reshape every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the Unknown:</strong> Every trial begins in uncertainty. Reveal the land tile by tile, uncovering resources you need and hazards that threaten to cut you off. The sooner you know the shape of the world, the better you can survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/ae273fbf39ca095ba41082de40c5c968.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/ae273fbf39ca095ba41082de40c5c968.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/ae273fbf39ca095ba41082de40c5c968.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather With Purpose:</strong>\u00a0Food, water, and materials are never guaranteed. The ecosystem shifts between phases, yields weaken, and seasons rewrite the rules of survival. Every harvest is temporary - take what you can while the opportunity lasts, and weigh each step against hunger, thirst, and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/b1d8c3cdd4a9b42e12632da90a56bd31.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/b1d8c3cdd4a9b42e12632da90a56bd31.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/b1d8c3cdd4a9b42e12632da90a56bd31.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Your Gains:</strong> What you carry is fragile. Animals and hazards contest every resource, yet you need them not only to survive but also to unlock tools that open new ways forward. Each gain you hold strengthens your actions and pushes you closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/7cdb64584fbae3601fd20401c794d3c4.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/7cdb64584fbae3601fd20401c794d3c4.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/7cdb64584fbae3601fd20401c794d3c4.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Evolve</strong>: No trial stands still. The ecosystem declines, the seasons rewrite survival rules, and sudden events twist the land against you. Yields shrink, hazards spread, and strategies that once worked soon fall apart. Survival depends on how well you adapt - finding new ways forward with the tools at hand, as the Elder reshapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Trial is a Designed</strong>\u00a0<strong>Challenge</strong><br>Each map is a focused survival challenge. The levels are not procedurally generated, but shifting conditions, hazards, and tool unlocks make them replayable with multiple viable strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons That Fight Back</strong><br>Summer feeds you, autumn starves you. The bog slows your feet, frost blocks your path, and drought steals your water, every change demands a new plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools inside each trial to gain new survival actions. Each tool reshapes your options, opens new paths, and counters threats in unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Land Judges You</strong><br>Overuse it and it withers. Protect it and it thrives, rewarding you with better yields and safer paths. The ecosystem remembers your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Enduring</strong><br>Hand-painted tiles inspired by Estonian nature and mythology bring the trials to life,\u00a0 every tile is beautiful, every step is dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Where Solitude Tests Your Limits</strong><br>No tribe. No second chances. Only your decisions shape your survival. Explore, adapt, and endure, the Elder is watching.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312670?t=1761120426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312670?t=1761120426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/0d1f65730609d4ea11633f9126b49be81820c4b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761120426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/0d1f65730609d4ea11633f9126b49be81820c4b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761120426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Elder\u2019s Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons of Solitude is a turn-based survival strategy set in a hand-painted prehistoric world inspired by Estonian nature and myth. You are in exile. Each trial demands foresight: read the land, endure its wildlife, and keep the ecosystem in fragile balance as shifting seasons reshape every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the Unknown:</strong> Every trial begins in uncertainty. Reveal the land tile by tile, uncovering resources you need and hazards that threaten to cut you off. The sooner you know the shape of the world, the better you can survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/ae273fbf39ca095ba41082de40c5c968.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/ae273fbf39ca095ba41082de40c5c968.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co