i.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/7cdb64584fbae3601fd20401c794d3c4.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Evolve</strong>: No trial stands still. The ecosystem declines, the seasons rewrite survival rules, and sudden events twist the land against you. Yields shrink, hazards spread, and strategies that once worked soon fall apart. Survival depends on how well you adapt - finding new ways forward with the tools at hand, as the Elder reshapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.poster.avif?t=1761120426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.webm?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/344f3c806dbc63d3cb907a5b2c64c1eb.mp4?t=1761120426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Trial is a Designed</strong>\u00a0<strong>Challenge</strong><br>Each map is a focused survival challenge. The levels are not procedurally generated, but shifting conditions, hazards, and tool unlocks make them replayable with multiple viable strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons That Fight Back</strong><br>Summer feeds you, autumn starves you. The bog slows your feet, frost blocks your path, and drought steals your water, every change demands a new plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools inside each trial to gain new survival actions. Each tool reshapes your options, opens new paths, and counters threats in unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Land Judges You</strong><br>Overuse it and it withers. Protect it and it thrives, rewarding you with better yields and safer paths. The ecosystem remembers your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Enduring</strong><br>Hand-painted tiles inspired by Estonian nature and mythology bring the trials to life,\u00a0 every tile is beautiful, every step is dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Where Solitude Tests Your Limits</strong><br>No tribe. No second chances. Only your decisions shape your survival. Explore, adapt, and endure, the Elder is watching.</p>","developers":["Ninjarithm"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/header.jpg?t=1761120426","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312670/1881463759/f8f32fedf38d4d04c7f908448eadc80b705d9eb7/1761072798/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761073518","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312670/1881463759/f8f32fedf38d4d04c7f908448eadc80b705d9eb7/1761072798/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761073518","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312670/1881463759/f8f32fedf38d4d04c7f908448eadc80b705d9eb7/1761072798/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761073518","id":257070605,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070605/movie480.mp4?t=1761073518","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st